  "description": "MobileServer 安卓本地服务器组件清单：所有二进制均为 arm64 (aarch64, Android bionic) 独立静态包，运行时由 APP 下载、解压到 files/server/bin/ 下执行。",
  "base_url": "https://github.com/Hjilin/mobileserver-bin-resources/releases/download/v1.0.0",
  "components": {
